<title>JAPAN: Okura up on computer repair hopes.</title>
<headline>Okura up on computer repair hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Okura &amp; Co Ltd leaped in Wednesday afternoon trade, as investors hoped that the firm's unit would solve computer problems related to the year 2000, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0528 GMT, the shares were up 55 at 415, the largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
